{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s91d7c0d5f171b0dc","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-627d88273bd9f2c9a04a","text":"撮影のほうはどんな感じ？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e8089e12222f0966d006","text":"（写真を見せる）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-16327afa88a256a3ef46","text":"ありがとう、[開拓者]！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-18ad28b872600988d0ff","text":"いい感じに撮れてるよ{F#ね}{M#な}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-43c493dd713099a2a97b","text":"この写真、よく撮れてるよ{F#ね}{M#な}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8de2e7ec1d4aaab34ea2","text":"アンタ、本当に才能あるかも","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9c746ab2c6bdbe701a46","text":"あんまりうまく撮れてないかも…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-fb0d65391aad475c1915","text":"あんまりうまく撮れてない気がするけど…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c4518dec9592701d86ad","text":"大丈夫、十分すごいから！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dd4447b210f112056483","text":"お疲れ様、明日になったら新しい写真を送るね！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a5bf582366b8dc04d98d","text":"いいお知らせを待ってるよ～","speaker":""}]}
